    "name": {
      "value": "Viking"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "apg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "To go \"a-viking\" is to raid by sea, and thus vikings have spread far and wide. Some have even settled in the very communities they once raided. Vikings traditionally travel in longboats; a score of these warriors might live aboard their ship for days at a time, sailing the seas (or, as they call it, the \"whale-road\") to ambush coastal communities. Once they arrive at a settlement, they charge ashore, plundering all they can find and slaying anyone foolish enough to get in their way. The ferocity of viking raids is legendary."
    },
